 $('legendNotes').textContent='Assigned CCNs only; Pending identities excluded. These are corpus mentions, not national failure rates. Sizes rescale within each view; compare exact counts across views. Area follows hospice count, with a minimum visible radius. Zoom changes apparent size. The selected color is explained below the map.';
